WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.910
A bishop lays his hands
on a man's head and prays.

2
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.690
A new Catholic priest is ordained.

3
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.620
Yet a letter in the New
Testament tells believers:

4
00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:12.270
you are a royal priesthood.

5
00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:16.190
That letter speaks to all
believers, not only to the clergy.

6
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.200
So do Christians need
a priest to reach God,

7
00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.630
or is every believer a priest?

8
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.720
In this mission, you'll
climb the Catholic hierarchy,

9
00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:27.010
from the laity up to the pope.

10
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:31.500
Then you'll see how Presbyterian and
Anglican Churches organise and ordain their

11
00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:32.650
leaders.

12
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.990
Your mission: find out whether
Christians need a priest to reach God.
